  "content": [
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 1,
        "tag": "h1"
      },
      "text": "Aegis Series-7 Hydraulic Control System — Operator Manual",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "text": "Document AEG-OM-700, Revision 1 (superseded). Applies to software revisions 3.0 and 3.1 only.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 3,
        "tag": "h2"
      },
      "text": "1. Overview",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 4,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "text": "The Aegis Series-7 Hydraulic Control System provides closed-loop hydraulic pressure regulation\nfor industrial press lines. The system is built around the Hydraulic Power Pack, which supplies\npressurized fluid to the press circuit under the supervision of the Aegis Controller.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 5,
        "tag": "h2"
      },
      "text": "2. Key Components",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 6,
        "tag": "table"
      },
      "text": "Reference Component Function Hydraulic Power Pack Hydraulic Power Pack (HPU) Generates and regulates hydraulic pressure IV-21 Isolation Valve 21 Isolates the HPU from the press circuit PS-04 Pressure Sensor 04 Reports HPU discharge pressure to the controller",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 7,
        "tag": "h2"
      },
      "text": "4. Starting the Hydraulic Power Pack",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 8,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "text": "Before starting, verify:",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 9,
        "tag": "li"
      },
      "text": "Hydraulic fluid level is within the normal band.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 10,
        "tag": "li"
      },
      "text": "Isolation valve IV-21 is open.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 11,
        "tag": "li"
      },
      "text": "Emergency stop is reset.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 12,
        "tag": "li"
      },
      "text": "Turn the POWER selector to ON.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 13,
        "tag": "li"
      },
      "text": "Press START.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 14,
        "tag": "li"
      },
      "text": "Verify pressure reaches 180 bar .",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 15,
        "tag": "h2"
      },
      "text": "5. Normal Operating Ranges",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 16,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "text": "Normal HPU discharge pressure is 180 bar, as measured by pressure sensor PS-04.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 17,
        "tag": "h2"
      },
      "text": "6. Alarms",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 18,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "text": "See the Aegis Alarm Reference for alarm A17 (Hydraulic Pressure Low) and related codes.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    },
    {
      "location": {
        "element": 19,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "text": "This legacy export does not reflect ECN-1042 (PS-04 to PS-04A sensor change and pressure setpoint\nupdate to 200 bar, effective software revision 3.2) or ECN-1058. Do not use this document as the\nsole reference for units running software revision 3.2 or later.",
      "extraction_method": "html"
    }
  ]
}